  "notes": "Compatible patch release carrying the accepted route-free storage-atomic settlement-adapter foundation for issue #430. The adapter delegates finite signed game actions to the existing public ledger debit-once and credit-once boundaries, preserves caller audit details, adds canonical action evidence, and permits post-conflict recovery only from exact compatible committed proof. It remains game-inert and route-free; later state-store and game-wiring phases remain separately governed. Frozen API compatibility and standard envelopes remain intact. No database schema, provider, DNS, billing, public signup, live OAuth, mail, invitation, public exposure, credential, or SSH-ingress behavior changes. Exact immutable v0.9.5.28 remains the application-only predecessor, MySQL schema 2 remains exact, and database rollback is prohibited."
